01:07.091 --> 01:07.926
I mean...

01:09.693 --> 01:12.904
If people have intercourse,
they are connected with a line.

01:13.066 --> 01:15.193
And putting on these glasses
lets you see the lines?

01:18.869 --> 01:21.622
You said you were
able to see them from birth?

01:30.211 --> 01:31.045
Come on!

01:31.546 --> 01:33.089
Stop joking around.

01:34.140 --> 01:37.268
I know you high school kids are untamable

01:37.414 --> 01:38.373
but I'm a detective.

01:38.457 --> 01:39.875
Don't underestimate me.

01:40.784 --> 01:42.286
I knew you wouldn't believe me.

01:44.483 --> 01:45.651
Hey, wait.

01:48.253 --> 01:49.880
I never said I didn't believe you.

01:52.489 --> 01:53.448
So you're saying

01:54.373 --> 01:57.001
that someone took Seon-a's glasses,

01:58.141 --> 02:01.060
called her to the school rooftop,
and then pushed her.

02:02.092 --> 02:03.302
Possibly.

02:04.308 --> 02:05.977
Who? And why?

02:08.291 --> 02:09.417
I don't know.

02:10.062 --> 02:12.439
Seon-a isn't someone who'd kill herself...

02:14.005 --> 02:16.800
but she was threatening people
about their S lines.

02:18.057 --> 02:19.350
She had plenty of enemies.

02:22.261 --> 02:23.303
Do you think it's possible

02:24.102 --> 02:26.021
there's more than one pair of the glasses?

02:26.954 --> 02:30.499
Recently, there's been a series of cases
similar to the one that happened

02:30.524 --> 02:32.762
in the apartment above yours.

02:39.782 --> 02:41.700
What am I even saying
to a high school kid?

02:43.981 --> 02:44.982
Wait.

02:46.273 --> 02:48.608
Do you see a blur of red everywhere then?

02:49.171 --> 02:50.005
Yes.

02:51.114 --> 02:51.948
More or less.

02:53.541 --> 02:55.668
That explains the sunglasses.

02:58.755 --> 03:01.216
It can't have been easy for you.

03:29.494 --> 03:30.495
Seon-a.

03:35.625 --> 03:36.460
Kang Seon-a.

03:46.178 --> 03:47.304
What are you doing?

03:48.388 --> 03:49.681
Stop sleeping in my class.

03:50.682 --> 03:52.017
Let's concentrate, everyone.

03:52.100 --> 03:55.145
So we have autosomes and sex chromosomes.

03:55.229 --> 03:56.605
There's one pair of sex chromosomes

03:56.688 --> 03:59.483
and the remaining 22 are autosomes.

03:59.566 --> 04:01.485
Autosomes determine our...

04:01.568 --> 04:02.903
Come on, run!

04:02.986 --> 04:03.821
Shoot!

04:05.739 --> 04:06.824
Are you okay?

04:07.700 --> 04:09.660
- Why?
- Well...

04:10.828 --> 04:13.414
She cried out loud in class
when she woke up from her sleep earlier.

04:14.999 --> 04:16.041
Listen.

04:16.125 --> 04:18.252
It's all because you haven't
gotten enough sunshine.

04:19.336 --> 04:20.838
Let's go somewhere nice this weekend.

04:21.338 --> 04:23.215
- I can't.
- Why not?

04:23.799 --> 04:25.342
You don't want to? Or you can't?

04:26.260 --> 04:27.386
I have plans.

04:27.470 --> 04:28.304
What plans?

04:31.766 --> 04:32.850
I got a part-time job.

04:32.875 --> 04:34.727
You did? What kind of job?

04:37.897 --> 04:38.940
Stop pestering her.

04:39.899 --> 04:41.192
She might not want to tell us.

04:45.905 --> 04:47.031
It's at the Miseong Motel.

04:47.114 --> 04:48.157
- Miseong Motel?
- Miseong Motel?

04:50.133 --> 04:51.009
Ms. Kim Mi-seong.

04:52.328 --> 04:53.329
Yes?

04:59.001 --> 05:01.003
This was your second attempt.

05:01.087 --> 05:02.797
How can you make the same mistakes?

05:06.301 --> 05:08.136
You're driving me up the wall.

05:11.806 --> 05:13.099
Do it over.

05:14.309 --> 05:15.518
I'm sorry.

05:28.490 --> 05:30.283
Stupid virgin.

06:00.355 --> 06:02.232
They have the best nuggets there.

06:02.733 --> 06:04.401
You should try their rolls too.

06:06.121 --> 06:07.747
Where did you grow up, Mi-seong?

06:08.405 --> 06:09.239
In Busan.

06:10.449 --> 06:11.783
But you don't have an accent.

06:12.284 --> 06:13.535
I tried hard to get rid of it.

06:14.912 --> 06:15.996
Why?

06:17.289 --> 06:19.374
Because I'm trying to get into acting.

06:24.088 --> 06:25.172
To be an actress?

06:26.006 --> 06:26.840
Yes.

06:28.676 --> 06:30.970
I was approached
by a casting director once.

06:41.350 --> 06:42.976
Is the music teacher seeing anyone?

06:43.649 --> 06:45.359
Why? Are you interested?

06:45.442 --> 06:46.569
He's cute.

06:47.278 --> 06:48.988
- Should I ask him for you?
- Yes.

06:50.072 --> 06:51.198
Do you think he's single?

06:51.782 --> 06:52.992
Just finish your lunch.

07:51.760 --> 07:56.806
MISEONG MOTEL

07:56.890 --> 08:01.227
MISEONG MOTEL

08:13.740 --> 08:16.701
RECEPTION

08:16.785 --> 08:19.621
NO MINORS ALLOWED

08:24.459 --> 08:25.919
Hi. Day room, please.

08:26.847 --> 08:28.140
That will be 30,000 won.

08:28.640 --> 08:30.391
Can't we go to a hotel instead?

08:31.258 --> 08:33.302
We're only staying a couple of hours.

08:39.779 --> 08:40.780
Thanks.

08:44.730 --> 08:47.608
You always say
you'll take me to a nice place.

08:47.691 --> 08:49.318
I'll take you to a hotel next time.

08:56.460 --> 08:59.004
Seon-a's bully, Kim Hye-yeong...

09:00.086 --> 09:02.422
