09:04.166 --> 09:05.626
Except she's totally vanished.

09:06.836 --> 09:09.004
No credit card or phone records.

09:09.955 --> 09:11.082
Or...

09:11.882 --> 09:13.217
the Korean teacher

09:14.009 --> 09:15.720
pushed Seon-a from the roof

09:15.803 --> 09:18.431
and killed himself
due to a guilty conscience.

09:19.432 --> 09:21.350
That's the most probable scenario.

09:21.976 --> 09:24.562
His cell phone signal was picked up
on the school premises.

09:25.771 --> 09:28.858
Except the Korean teacher
was basically missing

09:28.941 --> 09:30.902
until his dead body turned up.

09:30.985 --> 09:33.863
And his family says
he had severe acrophobia,

09:33.946 --> 09:36.491
making it impossible for him
to push someone off a roof.

09:38.159 --> 09:39.494
If what they say is true.

09:43.164 --> 09:44.582
Then who could it be?

09:46.959 --> 09:47.794
Ji-uk.

09:51.798 --> 09:53.925
Could Seon-a have...

09:56.219 --> 09:57.929
KANG SEON-A

10:02.684 --> 10:03.893
It wasn't a suicide attempt.

10:05.228 --> 10:08.022
I'm not just being stubborn.
Something's bothering me.

10:08.106 --> 10:08.940
GLASSES?

10:09.023 --> 10:12.277
Seon-a changed
once she started wearing the glasses.

10:14.331 --> 10:15.874
