11:48.499 --> 11:50.918
Why did you want to come inside, anyway?

11:51.002 --> 11:52.003
It's fun.

11:53.212 --> 11:55.256
It's thrilling.

12:02.943 --> 12:04.027
A day room, please.

12:04.599 --> 12:06.184
I'd like Room 206.

12:08.561 --> 12:09.645
Did she come alone?

12:21.115 --> 12:22.700
I'm sure I know her from somewhere.

12:58.278 --> 12:59.237
It's true.

13:00.363 --> 13:01.990
I've had many men

13:02.908 --> 13:04.242
as lovers in my life.

13:07.954 --> 13:08.955
But...

13:11.625 --> 13:13.251
