13:50.456 --> 13:52.500
I want to have sex!

13:53.042 --> 13:53.918
You're crazy.

13:55.147 --> 13:56.690
You don't even have a boyfriend.

14:00.091 --> 14:01.884
Not now I don't,
but I had plenty in the past.

14:01.967 --> 14:04.387
You mean the guys you stalked?

14:04.470 --> 14:06.430
You're one to talk, mister virgin.

14:17.358 --> 14:20.278
- What?
- I knew it.

14:20.361 --> 14:22.280
- What?
- The woman who came in by herself.

14:23.710 --> 14:25.253
She works in the school admin office.

14:25.921 --> 14:27.465
You know, the one with the glasses.

14:28.202 --> 14:29.704
Are you sure that's her?

14:30.496 --> 14:32.123
She looks so different.

14:32.874 --> 14:35.960
But she can't get past my sharp eye.

14:56.465 --> 14:57.674
Keep it down, will you?

15:50.119 --> 15:52.621
HWAGYEONG-DONG MARITICIDE CASE

15:57.407 --> 15:58.283
She's Shin Hyeon-heup.

15:58.437 --> 16:01.023
Her mom killed her dad
and ran away when she was a kid.

16:08.137 --> 16:09.972
KILLED HER HUSBAND WITH A KITCHEN KNIFE

16:10.055 --> 16:11.682
VICTIM WAS DEAD ON ARRIVAL

