19:51.196 --> 19:52.197
Sorry.

19:53.448 --> 19:54.950
The music is so beautiful.

19:56.034 --> 19:56.952
I couldn't help myself.

19:58.119 --> 19:59.412
It must be nice,

20:00.539 --> 20:02.791
