20:03.750 --> 20:04.876
It doesn't do me any good.

20:05.710 --> 20:08.130
I spend every day with high school kids.

20:10.507 --> 20:11.758
You're Mi-seong, right?

20:16.346 --> 20:18.348
- You remembered.
- I did.

20:24.897 --> 20:26.398
