21:35.463 --> 21:36.043
Yes.

21:37.244 --> 21:38.057
Where's Gyeong-jin?

21:40.812 --> 21:42.381
Something came up, so she left early.

21:55.599 --> 21:56.179
By the way...

21:59.928 --> 22:00.717
are you free today?

22:20.873 --> 22:22.766
You seemed to like empty places.

22:24.619 --> 22:25.781
How did you find this place?

22:26.790 --> 22:28.484
I was on the swimming team in junior high.

22:29.633 --> 22:30.976
I'm not anymore

22:31.717 --> 22:33.305
but I'd come here sometimes to swim.

22:52.416 --> 22:53.328
Do you know how to swim?

22:55.524 --> 22:56.350
