24:21.165 --> 24:23.633
HOT BOWL NOODLES

24:24.954 --> 24:26.310
It's all ready. Let's dig in.

24:43.422 --> 24:44.119
It's good.

24:45.562 --> 24:46.696
Are you sure we can eat here?

24:47.249 --> 24:49.016
Yes, so long as we don't get caught.

24:50.078 --> 24:51.430
If Gyeong-jin were here,

24:51.455 --> 24:53.105
she'd have brought a portable stove.

25:14.080 --> 25:14.794
By the way,

25:16.415 --> 25:17.177
why'd you jump earlier?

25:23.336 --> 25:24.729
It's okay if you
don't want to talk about it.

25:25.420 --> 25:26.030
Sorry.

25:34.365 --> 25:34.946
Ever since

25:36.798 --> 25:37.759
I was little...

25:39.877 --> 25:40.980
I can see these weird things.

25:45.195 --> 25:46.290
I can see red lines

25:48.130 --> 25:49.360
above people's heads.

25:55.009 --> 25:55.706
Like this?

25:57.490 --> 25:58.158
Yes.

26:01.952 --> 26:02.806
Do I have one?

26:05.242 --> 26:06.032
You don't.

26:09.544 --> 26:10.299
It's the same for me

26:11.982 --> 26:12.969
and Gyeong-jin.

26:21.580 --> 26:23.366
Do you believe what I'm saying?

26:24.012 --> 26:25.452
- Yes.
- How come?

26:26.781 --> 26:28.116
Why would you lie?

26:34.918 --> 26:35.858
I'm weird, aren't I?

26:37.347 --> 26:37.986
Yes.

26:39.282 --> 26:40.249
You're not run-of-the-mill.

26:41.815 --> 26:42.512
I knew it.

26:44.117 --> 26:44.901
I think you're cool.

26:48.333 --> 26:49.585
I'm far too ordinary.

26:52.139 --> 26:54.116
No one would know
if I disappeared tomorrow.

26:57.980 --> 26:58.874
If you were to,

27:00.460 --> 27:02.944
at least Gyeong-jin and I would know.

27:06.258 --> 27:06.868
I guess you're right.

27:39.122 --> 27:43.335
I keep telling you. It's not me.

27:43.410 --> 27:45.065
Do I look like a scammer,

27:45.397 --> 27:46.268
Ms. Kang Su-min?

27:48.876 --> 27:49.573
Hey.

27:50.655 --> 27:51.718
It's been a while, Ji-uk.

27:52.494 --> 27:53.530
It has been.

27:54.507 --> 27:56.413
Why didn't you take my calls?
I missed you.

27:57.665 --> 27:58.333
Well...

27:59.713 --> 28:02.452
I can't be seen talking to a criminal.

28:03.468 --> 28:05.045
When was I not one?

28:06.482 --> 28:08.264
You were just a suspect then.

28:10.132 --> 28:12.545
Are you always this picky?

28:14.612 --> 28:16.693
I'm done here, right? I'm free to go?

28:17.202 --> 28:17.870
Okay.

28:20.766 --> 28:21.462
Take my calls.

28:26.075 --> 28:27.913
Ji-uk, when did you...

28:29.568 --> 28:30.666
Mind your own business.

28:31.082 --> 28:33.330
LEE JI-WON

28:37.190 --> 28:42.126
KANG SEON-A

28:42.151 --> 28:44.218
BOYFRIEND?

28:49.692 --> 28:50.301
Ji-uk.

28:51.185 --> 28:53.039
Aren't you dating anyone these days?

28:55.634 --> 28:57.371
When have I ever dated anyone?

28:57.643 --> 29:00.624
Well, not technically,
but you always kept yourself busy.

29:03.068 --> 29:03.765
I guess.

29:04.819 --> 29:05.673
A hiatus, maybe?

29:14.538 --> 29:15.773
There's someone I'm curious about.

29:17.158 --> 29:18.000
But not in a sexual way.

29:18.734 --> 29:20.070
No way. How come?

29:20.932 --> 29:21.738
What do you mean?

29:22.577 --> 29:24.459
Can I not be just curious about someone?

29:38.419 --> 29:39.203
I'd like a day room.

29:40.611 --> 29:41.781
Room 206, please.

30:09.344 --> 30:10.041
It's true.

30:10.882 --> 30:13.128
I've had many men as lovers in my life.

30:28.139 --> 30:29.300
It's true.

30:29.630 --> 30:31.672
