30:37.734 --> 30:40.514
I've had many men as lovers in my life.

30:45.160 --> 30:45.812
It's true.

30:47.070 --> 30:48.611
I've had many men

30:50.143 --> 30:51.523
as lovers in my life.

30:57.626 --> 30:58.469
At first...

30:59.890 --> 31:03.050
