33:22.375 --> 33:23.072
Hey.

34:06.222 --> 34:07.636
Why a motel, out of nowhere?

34:08.194 --> 34:09.355
Just for old times' sake.

34:10.305 --> 34:11.351
It is refreshing, I guess.

34:19.142 --> 34:20.250
Didn't you miss me?

34:22.185 --> 34:23.637
I can see you whenever on TV.

34:29.402 --> 34:30.099
You're so funny.

36:14.483 --> 36:15.257
Are you leaving?

36:16.924 --> 36:18.141
How about the same time tomorrow?

36:34.658 --> 36:38.263
